<title>UK: Centrica chairman Giordano retires.</title>
<headline>Centrica chairman Giordano retires.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrica Plc said Richard Giordano was retiring as chairman and director of the company from Tuesday.</p>
<p>Deputy chairman Michael Perry has been appointed non-executive chairman of the company.</p>
<p>British Gas announced in January, when it spun-off its gas supply business into a company called Centrica, that Giordano would be succeeded by former Unilever Plc boss Perry.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
